    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Framing will last for two weeks and will require our project director, solution architect, and one engineer." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Design phase will focus on designing the AI assistance solution for hospital staff, including the integration with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Design phase will also last for two weeks and will require our solution architect, two engineers, and our data scientist." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In Pilot, our will deploy the AI assistance solution for hospital staff to a limited perimeter of one or two departments and test the AI assistance solution for hospital staff functionality and effectiveness." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pilot will last for three months and will require our project director, solution architect, two engineers, and our security compliance lead." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generalisation will involve deploying the AI assistance solution for hospital staff to all services and ensuring the AI assistance solution for hospital staff integration with existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generalisation will last for six months and will require our entire dedicated team, including our project director, solution architect, two engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, in Run, our will ensure the continuous operation of the AI assistance solution for hospital staff and provide maintenance and support services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Run will last for two years and will require our project director, one engineer, and our security compliance lead." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout The project, our will have a joint steering committee with the client, meeting monthly, and an operational committee meeting fortnightly. our will also maintain a RACI matrix to ensure clear roles and responsibilities. our available capacity includes a dedicated team with a project director, solution architect, two engineers, one data scientist, and a shared security compliance lead. our also have additional resources for change management and training. our will allocate our resources according to the phase requirements, ensuring that our have the necessary expertise and capacity to deliver each phase's objectives. our timeline is estimated to be around 24 months, with the following milestones:  - Month 1-2: Framing phase - Month 3-4: Design phase - Month 5-8: Pilot phase - Month 9-14: Generalisation phase - Month 15-26: Run phase our will ensure that our solution complies with regulatory requirements such as GDPR and ensures data sovereignty by hosting our solution on a French sovereign cloud provider, OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and HDS-certified. our will also rely on our partnership with Ligeo Santé for health-IT integration and FHIR/INS interoperability work. our approach will guarantee the expected quality of service, ensure continuity of care, and reduce complexity of procedures while improving efficiency and quality of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds for common queries, integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds for common queries: FULLY COVERED. our platform, Atelier, has a median latency of 1.3 seconds, with common single-document queries being below 2 seconds at p95. has meets The client requirement. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI): FULLY COVERED. our have standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration, which can be used to integrate Our platform, Atelier with The client existing systems. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR): FULLY COVERED. our health interoperability capabilities include support for FHIR and HL7 standards, ensuring seamless communication between different healthcare systems. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent: PARTIALLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier with OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, our also offer other tiers that may not meet this specific requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our can propose using the Sovereign HDS tier with OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified to fulfill this specific requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would involve deploying Our platform, Atelier on the Sovereign HDS tier with OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, utilizing standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration, and supporting health interoperability standards through our built-in capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup ensures that all requirements are met while providing a robust and scalable solution for the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, including data sovereignty, no transfer of personal data outside the EU, encryption, and pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements? we have experience delivering solutions under GDPR, including handling special-category health data as per Article 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has been ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we solutions, including data protection. we also hold an ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data sovereignty and localization, we work with a hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring that data is hosted within a sovereign cloud infrastructure. work aligns with the requirement to not transfer personal data outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymisation, we data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we also employ pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Concerning explainability and auditability of AI outputs, we product Atelier supports a posteriori review, provides source grounding, and maintains an audit log, ensuring that the elements leading to an output can be understood through traceability and explanations for recommendations or suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag potential legal risks related to ensuring continuous compliance with evolving GDPR requirements and the specific constraints around health data processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's also crucial to ensure we contract includes a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) aligned with GDPR Article 28, which we have available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
